  "description": {
   "en": "The Rise of the #1 Ranked \u003cDawn\u003e Guild Master Terha and His Quest to Conquer the Game(?) World!\n\nHow would the Guild Master feel upon winning all the siege battles, only to wake up and discover it's 500 years later?\n\n\"Ah, this sucks...\"\n\nAll the guild members have vanished, and the guild itself has been destroyed. Moreover, something seems off about this world.\n\nThis won't do. Let's start by reviving the guild first.\n\nThe story of \u003cDawn\u003e Guild Master Terha, ranked #1, as he rebuilds his guild and aims to conquer the game(?) world.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, edited)"
  },
